WEBVTT

00:09:55.674 --> 00:10:01.055
If those in grocery, warehousing,
food processing, delivery,

00:10:01.055 --> 00:10:06.060
had strong unions,
indeed any unions at all,

00:10:06.060 --> 00:10:09.855
there would have been no need
for federal programs

00:10:09.897 --> 00:10:16.612
for those who have jobs to feed
their families and prevent evictions.

00:10:18.113 --> 00:10:20.240
Now there are many reasons
for union decline,

00:10:20.282 --> 00:10:22.534
including structural ones.

00:10:22.576 --> 00:10:26.163
The decline in union jobs
in manufacturing.

00:10:27.039 --> 00:10:31.126
But a major reason
is public lack of awareness,